DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Implement file system quotas.

     The _m_p___b_u_s_y argument is an input/output parameter.  VVFFSS__QQUUOOTTAACCTTLL() must
     be called with _m_p marked busy through vfs_busy(9) and _*_m_p___b_u_s_y set to
     true.  The filesystem implementation of VVFFSS__QQUUOOTTAACCTTLL() may then unbusy _m_p
     using vfs_unbusy(9) prior to performing quota file I/O.  In this case the
     implementation must set _*_m_p___b_u_s_y to false to indicate that the caller
     must not unbusy _m_p upon completion of VVFFSS__QQUUOOTTAACCTTLL().

     See quotactl(2) for a description of the remaining arguments.

